                            	     6R             ; |(plane0_bit<<1)|(plane1_bit). Note plane0 and plane1 land
                            	     7R             ; in the middle bits, not bits 0/1 as you'd naively guess --
                            	     8R             ; an earlier revision of the comments below (but NOT the
                            	     9R             ; code, which was always correct) had d5/d6 swapped relative
                            	    10R             ; to their actual load source just above (plane_buf0/buf1).
